# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The user's own data. It is created INSIDE this folder at runtime, because
# the skill's location is its scope. None of it may ever reach the repository:
# a committed profile hands one person's style to everyone who installs.
# `install.mjs --to` refuses to copy a source folder that holds a profile, and
# this file is the second lock on the same door.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
UserCommunicationProfile.md
profiles/
metalearning_*.md
DISABLED
*.speaksimple-backup-*

# Written by the `skills` CLI if it is ever run from this folder
skills-lock.json
.claude/
.agents/

node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
